                            <th title="Tokens per dollar">Tokens/$</th>
                            <th title="Average cost per conversation">Avg cost/conv</th>
                            <th title="Rank by $/1K tokens among priced models (lower is better). Best ★ needs at least two priced models and no tie; local models have no price and are not ranked.">Efficiency</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
